{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23564","headline":"拣贡橘书情 · 白居易","name":"拣贡橘书情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洞庭贡橘拣宜精，太守勤王请自行。\n珠颗形容随日长，琼浆气味得霜成。\n登山敢惜驽骀力，望阙难伸蝼蚁情。\n疎贱无由亲跪献，愿凭朱实表丹诚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23564.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23564","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}